+    /**
+     * Learns Twitch VIP/MOD status only from badges attached by Twitch to a real chat message.
+     * We intentionally do not request a broadcaster token. A negative observation is retained
+     * only for a user previously known as VIP/MOD so revocations are applied after their next message.
